# Unreal 二进制资产：禁止换行符转换、禁止文本 diff
*.uasset binary
*.umap binary
*.uexp binary
*.ubulk binary
*.ufont binary
*.bin binary
*.dll binary
*.exe binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary

# 文本资产统一 LF
*.ini text eol=lf
*.cs text eol=lf
*.cpp text eol=lf
*.h text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.html text eol=lf
*.uproject text eol=lf
*.uplugin text eol=lf
